@* Root component. Rendered by Tamp.Findings.Api via MapRazorComponents<App>.

   Render mode is chosen PER COMPONENT, not globally (ADR 0002): the dense
   screens want InteractiveServer, while the attestation (a print target that
   also feeds the PDF generator) and sign-in stay static SSR. So there is no
   @rendermode on <Routes /> here — each page declares its own. *@
<!DOCTYPE html>
@* lang must reflect the ACTUAL culture, not a hardcoded "en" — WCAG 2.1
   SC 3.1.1 Language of Page, and screen readers pick a voice from it. A
   hardcoded value is a lie the moment a second locale exists. *@
<html lang="@System.Globalization.CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    @* app.css @imports fonts.css and tokens.css. Fonts are vendored and served
       from this origin — no external CDN, because a self-hosted compliance
       tool must not report page views to a third party and must work
       air-gapped. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="_content/Tamp.Findings.Web/app.css" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>
<body>
    <Routes />
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
    <script src="_content/Tamp.Findings.Web/interop.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
